> I�[�]m reading[ the] Rust book in[ my spare] time for some time now and got to the topic of interior mutability.
Having a C[++] background I know similiar concepts from C[++] as well like[ const]_cast or mutable and I�[�]m really bugged by these things in C[++] all[ the] time because it let�[�]s you do things that you wouldn�[�]t expect from[ the public] API.
